note accept.om: the DRA-124 acceptance suite runner, reference stubs and IFEval self-test.
note Built by tests/omegallm/accept/build.sh as: om2, net/http.om, net/json.om, this file.
note Commands (PREREG.md is the normative description; this file implements it):
note   accept run HOST PORT SUITEDIR OUTDIR OMC MODEL CORPUSDIR|- [MUTANTOP]
note   accept stub PORT garbage|ref SUITEDIR [COUNT]
note   accept ifsel UPSTREAM OUT RESP
note   accept selftest FILE
note No LLM judge and no outside tokenizer: every check below is a byte or JSON rule.

